{"headword":"חָלַם²","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>vb. dream (</strong>NH <em>id.;</em> Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">ܚܠܰܡ</span>; <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲלַם</span>; Ethiopic ሐለመ: Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">حَلَمَ</span>, <em>dream, experience an emission of the seminal fluid, attain to puberty</em><strong>)</strong>—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 42:9\" href=\"/Genesis.42.9\">Gn 42:9</a> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:1\" href=\"/Daniel.2.1\">Dn 2:1</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">חָלַמְתִּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 37:9\" href=\"/Genesis.37.9\">Gn 37:9</a> + 3 times, <span dir=\"rtl\">חָלָ֑מְתִּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 37:6\" href=\"/Genesis.37.6\">Gn 37:6</a> + 2 times, etc., + 3 times Pf.; Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יַחֲלֹם</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 29:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.29.8\">Is 29:8</a> + 5 times, <span dir=\"rtl\">יַחְלְמוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 39:4\" href=\"/Job.39.4\">Jb 39:4</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיַּחַלְמוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 40:5\" href=\"/Genesis.40.5\">Gn 40:5</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יַחֲלֹמ֑וּן</span> <a data-ref=\"Joel 3:1\" href=\"/Joel.3.1\">Jo 3:1</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">נַחַלְמָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:11\" href=\"/Genesis.41.11\">Gn 41:11</a>, Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">חוֹלֵם</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 13:4\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.13.4\">Dt 13:4</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">חֹלֵם</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:1\" href=\"/Genesis.41.1\">Gn 41:1</a> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 13:2\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.13.2\">Dt 13:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 13:6\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.13.6\">6</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">חֹלְמִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 126:1\" href=\"/Psalms.126.1\">ψ 126:1</a>—<em>dream:</em>"},{"senses":[{"definition":"of ordinary dreams of sleep <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 29:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.29.8\">Is 29:8</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 126:1\" href=\"/Psalms.126.1\">ψ 126:1</a>."}],"num":"a."},{"senses":[{"definition":"of dreams wit